INSERT INTO public.claims_backup (table_name, row_id, column_name, old_value, new_value)
VALUES ('products', '92', 'description', 'Title: Elevate Your Hair Care Routine with Our Neem Hair Care Set  Description:  Transform your hair care routine with our Neem Hair Care Set, meticulously curated to provide you with the ultimate hair care experience. Crafted with the finest ingredients and designed to cater to all hair types, our set comprises three essential elements: a luxurious handle, nourishing shampoo, and a delicate lily comb.   Indulge in the rejuvenating properties of neem, a natural powerhouse known for its remarkable benefits for hair and scalp health. Our handle, expertly crafted for comfort and durability, offers a luxurious grip, making it effortless to style and manage your locks. Say goodbye to tangles and knots as you glide through your hair with ease, thanks to the ergonomic design of our handle.  Pamper your hair with our nourishing shampoo, enriched with the goodness of neem extracts and other botanicals. Specially formulated to cleanse and revitalize your hair, our shampoo removes impurities, excess oil, and buildup, leaving your locks feeling fresh, vibrant, and full of life. Experience the gentle yet effective cleansing action that promotes healthy scalp conditions and promotes luscious, shiny hair.  Complete your hair care ritual with our exquisite lily comb, designed to gently detangle and style your hair without causing any damage or breakage. Crafted with precision and care, our comb features smooth, rounded teeth that effortlessly glide through your hair, leaving it soft, smooth, and tangle-free. Embrace the beauty of simplicity as you effortlessly create your desired hairstyles with our elegant lily comb.  Whether you have straight, curly, wavy, or coily hair, our Neem Hair Care Set is suitable for all hair types and textures. Experience the transformative power of nature as you nourish, strengthen, and beautify your hair with our premium hair care essentials. Elevate your self-care routine and unlock the secret to healthier, more radiant hair with our Neem Hair Care Set.  Treat yourself to the luxury of salon-quality hair care in the comfort of your own home. With our Neem Hair Care Set, achieving beautiful, healthy hair has never been easier. Invest in your hair''s health and beauty today and discover the difference that our premium hair care products can make. Say hello to gorgeous, vibrant hair that shines with vitality and radiance.', 'Title: Elevate Your Hair Care Routine with Our Neem Hair Care Set  Description:  Transform your hair care routine with our Neem Hair Care Set, meticulously curated to provide you with the ultimate hair care experience. Crafted with the finest ingredients and designed to cater to all hair types, our set comprises three essential elements: a luxurious handle, nourishing shampoo, and a delicate lily comb.   Indulge in the rejuvenating properties of neem, a natural powerhouse known for its remarkable benefits for hair and scalp health. Our handle, expertly crafted for comfort and durability, offers a luxurious grip, making it effortless to style and manage your locks. Say goodbye to tangles and knots as you glide through your hair with ease, thanks to the ergonomic design of our handle.  Pamper your hair with our nourishing shampoo, enriched with the goodness of neem extracts and other botanicals. Specially formulated to cleanse and revitalize your hair, our shampoo removes impurities, excess oil, and buildup, leaving your locks feeling fresh, vibrant, and full of life. Experience the gentle yet effective cleansing action that promotes healthy scalp conditions and promotes luscious, shiny hair.  Complete your hair care ritual with our exquisite lily comb, designed to gently detangle and style your hair without causing any damage or breakage. Crafted with precision and care, our comb features smooth, rounded teeth that effortlessly glide through your hair, leaving it soft, smooth, and tangle-free. Embrace the beauty of simplicity as you effortlessly create your desired hairstyles with our elegant lily comb.  Whether you have straight, curly, wavy, or coily hair, our Neem Hair Care Set is suitable for all hair types and textures. Experience the transformative power of nature as you nourish, strengthen, and beautify your hair with our premium hair care essentials. Elevate your self-care routine and unlock the secret to healthier, more radiant hair with our Neem Hair Care Set.  soothes yourself to the luxury of salon-quality hair care in the comfort of your own home. With our Neem Hair Care Set, achieving beautiful, healthy hair has never been easier. Invest in your hair''s health and beauty today and discover the difference that our premium hair care products can make. Say hello to gorgeous, vibrant hair that shines with vitality and radiance.');
