e, and timeless tradition.');
INSERT INTO public.claims_backup (table_name, row_id, column_name, old_value, new_value)
VALUES ('products', '98', 'description', '### **Natural Multani Mitti Shop: Rediscover the Timeless Beauty Secret**    Welcome to the **Natural Multani Mitti Shop**, your destination for pure and authentic Multani Mitti (Fuller’s Earth). Known as the age-old secret to flawless skin, Multani Mitti has been cherished for centuries for its ability to rejuvenate, cleanse, and beautify the skin naturally. At our shop, we offer premium-quality Multani Mitti sourced from natural deposits, ensuring it is free from additives or artificial chemicals.    ### **What is Multani Mitti?**   Multani Mitti, also known as Fuller’s Earth, is a natural clay that is rich in minerals like magnesium, silica, and calcium. Its remarkable absorbent and exfoliating properties make it an essential ingredient for skincare routines.    ### **Benefits of Multani Mitti**    #### **1. Deep Cleansing and Detoxification**   Multani Mitti acts as a natural cleanser, effectively removing dirt, oil, and impurities from the skin. It unclogs pores, prevents blackheads, and leaves your skin refreshed and radiant.    #### **2. Oil Control**   If you struggle with oily skin, Multani Mitti is your ultimate solution. It absorbs excess oil without stripping the skin of its natural moisture, helping to maintain a healthy balance and prevent breakouts.    #### **3. Fights Acne and Pimples**   With its antibacterial and cooling properties, Multani Mitti soothes inflammation, reduces redness, and prevents acne-causing bacteria. It dries out pimples naturally, reducing their size and preventing scars.    #### **4. Exfoliates Dead Skin Cells**   Multani Mitti gently exfoliates dead skin cells, revealing smoother, softer, and more radiant skin. Regular use improves texture and evens out the skin tone.    #### **5. Natural Skin Brightener**   Rich in minerals, Multani Mitti enhances the skin’s natural glow by improving blood circulation and removing tan. It’s a natural remedy for dull and tired-looking skin.    #### **6. Soothes Skin Irritations**   The cooling effect of Multani Mitti provides relief from sunburn, rashes, and minor irritations, making it ideal for sensitive skin types.    #### **7. Scalp and Hair Care**   Multani Mitti is not just for the skin! It can be used as a natural shampoo or hair mask to cleanse the scalp, remove dandruff, and add volume and shine to your hair.    ### **Why Choose Natural Multani Mitti Shop?**    1. **100% Pure and Natural**: Our Multani Mitti is sourced directly from nature, ensuring it is free from chemicals and synthetic additives.   2. **Versatile Applications**: Perfect for face packs, hair masks, and full-body treatments, our Multani Mitti caters to all your beauty needs.   3. **Eco-Friendly Packaging**: Committed to sustainability, our products come in environmentally friendly packaging.   4. **Suitable for All Skin Types**: Whether you have oily, dry, or sensitive skin, Multani Mitti is a gentle and effective solution.    ### **How to Use Multani Mitti**    - **For Face**: Mix Multani Mitti with rose water, milk, or aloe vera gel to form a smooth paste. Apply evenly on the face and neck, let it dry, and rinse with lukewarm water.   - **For Hair**: Combine Multani Mitti with water or yogurt to create a hair mask. Apply to the scalp and hair, leave for 20-30 minutes, and rinse thoroughly.    Discover the magic of natural beauty with **Natural Multani Mitti Shop**. Let the purity of Multani Mitti transform your skin and hair, giving you a natural glow and confidence like never before!', '### **Natural Multani Mitti Shop: Rediscover the Timeless Beauty Secret**    Welcome to the **Natural Multani Mitti Shop**, your destination for pure and authentic Multani Mitti (Fuller’s Earth). Known as the age-old secret to flawless skin, Multani Mitti has been cherished for centuries for its ability to rejuvenate, cleanse, and beautify the skin naturally. At our shop, we offer premium-quality Multani Mitti sourced from natural deposits, ensuring it is free from additives or artificial chemicals.    ### **What is Multani Mitti?**   Multani Mitti, also known as Fuller’s Earth, is a natural clay that is rich in minerals like magnesium, silica, and calcium. Its remarkable absorbent and exfoliating properties make it an essential ingredient for skincare routines.    ### **Benefits of Multani Mitti**    #### **1. Deep Cleansing and Detoxification**   Multani Mitti acts as a natural cleanser, effectively removing dirt, oil, and impurities from the skin. It unclogs pores, prevents blackheads, and leaves your skin refreshed and radiant.    #### **2. Oil Control**   If you struggle with oily skin, Multani Mitti is your ultimate solution. It absorbs excess oil without stripping the skin of its natural moisture, helping to maintain a healthy balance and prevent breakouts.    #### **3. Fights Acne and Pimples**   With its antibacterial and cooling properties, Multani Mitti soothes inflammation, reduces redness, and prevents acne-causing bacteria. It dries out pimples naturally, reducing their size and preventing scars.    #### **4. Exfoliates Dead Skin Cells**   Multani Mitti gently exfoliates dead skin cells, revealing smoother, softer, and more radiant skin. Regular use improves texture and evens out the skin tone.    #### **5. Natural Skin Brightener**   Rich in minerals, Multani Mitti enhances the skin’s natural glow by improving blood circulation and removing tan. It’s a natural remedy for dull and tired-looking skin.    #### **6. Soothes Skin Irritations**   The cooling effect of Multani Mitti provides relief from sunburn, rashes, and minor irritations, making it ideal for sensitive skin types.    #### **7. Scalp and Hair Care**   Multani Mitti is not just for the skin! It can be used as a natural shampoo or hair mask to cleanse the scalp, remove dandruff, and add volume and shine to your hair.    ### **Why Choose Natural Multani Mitti Shop?**    1. **100% Pure and Natural**: Our Multani Mitti is sourced directly from nature, ensuring it is free from chemicals and synthetic additives.   2. **Versatile Applications**: Perfect for face packs, hair masks, and full-body routines, our Multani Mitti caters to all your beauty needs.   3. **Eco-Friendly Packaging**: Committed to sustainability, our products come in environmentally friendly packaging.   4. **Suitable for All Skin Types**: Whether you have oily, dry, or sensitive skin, Multani Mitti is a gentle and effective solution.    ### **How to Use Multani Mitti**    - **For Face**: Mix Multani Mitti with rose water, milk, or aloe vera gel to form a smooth paste. Apply evenly on the face and neck, let it dry, and rinse with lukewarm water.   - **For Hair**: Combine Multani Mitti with water or yogurt to create a hair mask. Apply to the scalp and hair, leave for 20-30 minutes, and rinse thoroughly.    Discover the magic of natural beauty with **Natural Multani Mitti Shop**. Let the purity of Multani Mitti transform your skin and hair, giving you a natural glow and confidence like never before!');
