VALUES ('blogs', '8', 'short_description', 'Struggling with breakouts and acne blemishes? Learn how active ingredients like Tea Tree, Salicylic Acid, Multani Mitti, and Niacinamide heal acne safely.', 'Struggling with breakouts and acne blemishes? Learn how active ingredients like Tea Tree, Salicylic Acid, Multani Mitti, and Niacinamide nourishes acne safely.');

