UPDATE products SET "description" = 'YogKart Neem Wooden Comb is crafted from 100% natural neem wood, known for its antibacterial and antifungal properties. This eco-friendly comb helps reduce hair fall, prevents dandruff, and promotes healthy scalp circulation. Unlike plastic combs, it does not generate static electricity, making your hair smooth and frizz-free. Regular use helps distribute natural oils evenly from scalp to hair ends, improving shine and strength. Ideal for all hair types, this comb is durable, sustainable, and travel-friendly. It supports scalp health, reduces breakage, and enhances overall hair texture naturally without chemicals. A perfect choice for those who prefer Ayurvedic and herbal hair care solutions for long-term benefits and healthier healthy hair routine.' WHERE id = '1';
