UPDATE products SET "description" = 'Neem wooden comb is an ancient and natural tool used for health and beauty with various benefits. Neem wood comb is especially made from the wood of Neem tree, which has many medicinal properties.  Neem comb is a natural option that is considered great for healthy hair and scalp. It is exquisitely manufactured and available in various sizes and designs, giving you the option that best suits your needs.  Neem comb is also suitable for those who have to pay attention to the condition of their hair and who look for natural and safe solutions.  healthy hair routine can be increased with the use of Neem comb and its regular use makes the hair strong and healthy.  Using a neem comb improves the scalp condition and helps control hair volume, thereby reducing hair thinning or breakage.  Using Neem comb provides relief from dandruff and hair fall problems.  Using Neem comb increases the color, shine, and beauty of hair.  Moreover, Neem comb is a better alternative to combing in a natural way, which increases your awareness towards the health of your hair and the environment.  Proponents claim that regular use of a neem comb speeds up healthy hair routine, provides the latest stored energy to the hair follicles, and ensures hair health.  Ultimately, neem comb is a natural, cheap, and effective remedy that helps maintain the health and beauty of hair.' WHERE id = '82';
